				</h2>
				<div class="space-y-3 text-xs text-mapa-ink/80 leading-relaxed">
					<p>
						<strong>Luggage Dimensions:</strong> Bags or cargo measuring over 2 feet by 2 feet by 2 feet (60 cm x 60 cm x 60 cm) or weighing more than 30 kilograms are prohibited from boarding during peak commute hours.
					</p>
					<p>
						<strong>Folding Bikes and Kick Scooters:</strong> Under DOTr Memorandum Circular, folding bicycles with wheels not exceeding <strong>20 inches</strong> (406 mm / 451 mm) and folded kick scooters are permitted on LRT-1, LRT-2, and MRT-3. Bikes must be folded before entering the station security inspection checkpoint.
					</p>
					<p>
						<strong>Priority Passenger Car:</strong> The first car of every train is legally reserved for Senior Citizens, Persons with Disabilities, Pregnant Women, and passengers traveling with toddlers/infants.
					</p>
				</div>
